@segment  climb-f12-f15
@title    Climb — Focus 12 to Focus 15
@levels   F15
@fixed
@verbosity 3
@duration ~1m40s

say Now, you will move from Focus 12 into another state of being. Focus 15.
pause 4
say Focus 15 is the state of no time. A state not limited by time or space.
pause 5
say Because the energy that you are is beyond time, it is not controlled by time, and it can move freely.
pause 5
say To reach Focus 15 from Focus 12, all you need do is count up slowly in your mind to fifteen. Express the desire to be in no time, and you will move into that state.
pause 4
say I will count for you now.
pause 3
level F15
say Twelve.
pause 4
say Thirteen. You are moving out of the area of time, more and more.
pause 5
say Fourteen. You are moving into the state where time has no meaning. You remain calm and serene.
pause 5
say Fifteen. You are now in Focus 15. The state of no time. Where time does not exist.
pause 6
